  },
  {
   "id": 228,
   "en": "Tenia",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 229,
   "en": "Ngh, uuugh...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 230,
   "en": "...How long are you going to cry?@Sorry, but I can't keep up with this.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 231,
   "en": "The Orgone Extractor's output is down, but I can@still move. I'll drop you off at a nearby city,@and after that you're on your own.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 232,
   "en": "Wh... What's that supposed to mean...?!@I don't want to leave this place!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 233,
   "en": "...There's no time to look for bodies.@It's dangerous to stay here.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 234,
   "en": "Huh? Why?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 235,
   "en": "My gut's telling me so.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 236,
   "en": "Wh-What's going on!?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 237,
   "en": "An <Earth Federation Army> unit is here.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 238,
   "en": "Then there's nothing dangerous about it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 239,
   "en": "...I hope you're right.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 240,
   "en": "(...So-Des, you were careless.@Though this was unexpected for us as well.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 241,
   "en": "...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 242,
   "en": "Federation Soldier",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 243,
   "en": "...This is Lieutenant Bob Simmons of the Earth@Federation Army. We've come to rescue you.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 244,
   "en": "Calvina Coulange, test pilot for <Ashurey Kreuzer>.@Thanks for coming. The Bellzebine's been acting up@and I was in a bind.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 245,
   "en": "Bellzebine?@Isn't it the Bellzelute?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 246,
   "en": "(Tch, you idiot!)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 247,
   "en": "...I didn't submit any test flight plan@to the military. It was top secret.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 248,
   "en": "So why do you know@this machine's official name?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 249,
   "en": "Urk...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 250,
   "en": "You're not the Federation Army. Who are you?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 251,
   "en": "(So much for capturing it.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 252,
   "en": "Th-They're shooting at us!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 253,
   "en": "They might be part of the group@that attacked this place!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 254,
   "en": "Th-They're the ones...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 255,
   "en": "(At this output, fighting will be tough...!@And with a lead right in front of me...!)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 256,
   "en": "Those guys... I won't forgive them!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 257,
   "en": "...! The output went up?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 258,
   "en": "What, she wants to fight?@No, I'd expect that from that woman.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 259,
   "en": "Lord Jua-Mu!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 260,
   "en": "Jua-Mu",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 261,
   "en": "You fell for a cheap trick.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 262,
   "en": "M-My apologies!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 263,
   "en": "Never mind.@I've been wanting to wipe out that counterfeit.@Commence the attack.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 264,
   "en": "With this, I can fight...!@You're not saying no to this, Tenia!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 265,
   "en": "(Frozen stiff, huh? Can't blame her,@but I don't have time to deal with it.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 266,
   "en": "...Orgone Extractor confirmed stable.@Cytron linkage rate within acceptable range.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 267,
   "en": "What are you...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 268,
   "en": "The Cytron System activated a moment ago.@And now I know how to use it... It's coming@into my head...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 269,
   "en": "What do you mean...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 270,
   "en": "I'll... back you up.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 271,
   "en": "Hah, what can a kid do...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 272,
   "en": "I'm telling you, I know. How to use the system.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 273,
   "en": "(...Doesn't sound like a joke or sleep-talk.@The reason the Bellzelute is a two-seater,@the reason I have to put this girl aboard...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 274,
   "en": "(Ally and Seldoa never@told me anything clearly, but...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "en": "The enemy... The Mass-Produced Hückebein@Mk-IIs are moving.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "en": "All right.@You can do whatever you're able to,@just don't get in my way.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "en": "Calvina, something's coming!@There are four of them!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 278,
   "en": "This is Lieutenant Irmgard Kazahara of the PTX Team,@Earth Federation Army, <Steel Dragons>.@Both sides, cease hostilities!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "en": "The Steel Dragons...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "en": "(Hmph, so they've shown up.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "en": "Calvina Coulange, test pilot@for Ashurey Kreuzer.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "en": "Coulange? Hmm, where have I...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "en": "Then that machine was made@by Ashurey Kreuzer...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "en": "Just so you know, we're the ones being attacked.@If you want to question someone, question them.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "en": "We know they're not the Federation Army.@Leave this to us.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "en": "Sorry, but I've got a reason I can't back down!@Over and out!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "en": "What's with that attitude?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "en": "Can't be helped. We'll back her up.@There's been no reply at all from the other side.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "en": "Should we consider them enemies?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "en": "Yeah. If they won't back off knowing it's us,@they must be ready for what's coming.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "en": "Rio, the Exbein's tuning isn't@completely done yet... Are you okay?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "en": "Yeah, it doesn't handle that differently from@the Hückebein Mk-III. Honestly, though,@I'd have liked to finish tuning it properly.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "en": "Can't be helped. This is actually happening.@Maybe they moved up the delivery date@because they saw this coming.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "en": "The Commander? No way.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "en": "Lord Jua-Mu, I believe we should avoid@engaging them...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "en": "Sooner or later, it was fated to come to this.@You want to become Knights, don't you?@Then earn your merit here.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "en": "Y-Yes, sir!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "en": "Tch, in a machine like this...!@The Bellzelute alone would be one thing,@but now the Steel Dragons have shown up too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "en": "There'll be another chance...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "en": "Like I'd let a lead get away twice!@We're going after them, Tenia!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "en": "Hold it. Let's hear your story.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 302,
   "en": "Don't stop me!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 303,
   "en": "No can do.@As far as we're concerned, you're the lead.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 304,
   "en": "And if I say I'm going anyway?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 305,
   "en": "Then we'll have to stop you by force,@White Lynx.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 306,
   "en": "...It's been a while since anyone called me that.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 307,
   "en": "That's the leader's unit! Then!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 308,
   "en": "What are you going to do?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 309,
   "en": "Catch him and make him spill it!@Everything he knows!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 310,
   "en": "(I'll crush that counterfeit!)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 311,
   "en": "Now, who are these guys...@It'd be nice if they'd show their hand.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 312,
   "en": "Real combat right off the bat... In a way, that's@a fitting debut for a machine that carries on@the Hückebein lineage.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 313,
   "en": "I don't know who you are, but I'll show you@the power of the Exbein Gunner!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 314,
   "en": "As a member of the new PTX Team,@I'll carry out my mission...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 315,
   "en": "Lunar Space",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 316,
   "en": "Transport",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 317,
   "en": "Transport Interior",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 318,
   "en": "Lieutenant Irm, did you know her?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 319,
   "en": "Yeah, I'd heard stories about a gorgeous, skilled ace@from the <DC War> and the <L5 Campaign>: Lieutenant@Calvina Coulange... a.k.a. the White Lynx.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 320,
   "en": "There are plenty of other stories about aces.@I'm surprised you remembered.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 321,
   "en": "(I bet the gorgeous part scored big points with him.@She really is beautiful, though.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 322,
   "en": "Still, I never figured the White Lynx had retired@and become a test pilot for a private company.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 323,
   "en": "A lot happened.@Though I guess it's former test pilot now.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 324,
   "en": "We checked too. There were no survivors@at <Ashurey Kreuzer>.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 325,
   "en": "What's your name?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 326,
   "en": "Festenia Muse...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 327,
   "en": "Why were you aboard the Bellzelute?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 328,
   "en": "Why...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 329,
   "en": "Huh?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 330,
   "en": "Why did they do something so horrible?@Mom and Dad, Melua and Katia...@Everyone... everyone...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 331,
   "en": "Stop it. No one here can answer that.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 332,
   "en": "But...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 333,
   "en": "I want to know too. Who they are,@what they're after... But the ones who@stopped me are right here.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 334,
   "en": "Don't go pointing that at us.@We've got a mountain of questions ourselves.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 335,
   "en": "Then hurry up and ask.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 336,
   "en": "Then the same as Rio asked before.@Why did you have Festenia aboard the Bellzelute?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 337,
   "en": "Those were just my orders.@Though it looks like it was set up with her@in mind as the sub-pilot.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 338,
   "en": "What do you mean?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 339,
   "en": "The Cytron System told me.@That's how I knew how to operate it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 340,
   "en": "Cytron?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 341,
   "en": "I thought it was a backup control system,@but I don't know the details.@I never used it in the simulator.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 342,
   "en": "Maybe it's something like the Grungust's brainwave@control device or the <T-LINK System>.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 343,
   "en": "Either way, I can't use it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 344,
   "en": "Then Festenia has some kind@of aptitude...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 345,
   "en": "I... don't know anything about that.@Dad just told me all I had to do was ride along...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 346,
   "en": "Honestly, I had my doubts too about having a kid@ride along on a prototype test.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 347,
   "en": "To begin with, I didn't know Ashurey Kreuzer@was developing humanoid mobile weapons...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 348,
   "en": "The Bellzelute is the first prototype.@Not that trade secrets matter at this point.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 349,
   "en": "Then what about the ones who attacked?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 350,
   "en": "I don't know anything, so I tried to go after them.@Including that gray unknown that vanished@before the rest.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 351,
   "en": "There was another one?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 352,
   "en": "That's right. Not that it matters now.@It had to be that thing that attacked@Ashurey Kreuzer...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 353,
   "en": "Jeez, sounds like this runs deep.@Sorry, but you'll be coming with us after this.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 354,
   "en": "Am I under arrest?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 355,
   "en": "Well, who knows.@For now, we'll head back to the Steel Dragons'@flagship Hagane and question you there.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 356,
   "en": "...I fought in an unregistered mobile weapon,@so I guess that's natural. As a former soldier,@I understand.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 357,
   "en": "Thanks. I'll be sure to add that@it was self-defense.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 358,
   "en": "(Being on a warship with good intelligence-gathering@might be better than acting alone...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 359,
   "en": "(Ally, everyone...@I'll avenge you, I swear...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  }
 ]
}